ible;'>\n<span>\n</span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;'>\n          入口是莓果的果香然后带着红心柚子，\n         </span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;'>\n          特别舒服的酸甜感，很干净，就好像喝一杯没有加糖的红色莓果果汁一样～也有点让我想起在澜沧吃到的多衣的果干，很喜欢！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n            处理过程\n           </span>\n           ：鲜果采收后，运送到Alto Lino处理厂，进行浮选后放置在干燥室的晒床上进行4天的初始干燥，含水率大概下降到45%左右，再将咖啡果放入塑料袋中发酵3天；发酵结束后将咖啡果放置在18摄氏度恒温，湿度50%的干燥室中干燥35天；\n          </span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n           处理方式：泉水里静置厌氧日晒后低温缓慢干燥 River Flow Fermentation &amp; Low Temp Slow Dried\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n           采收日期：2025.1.13\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          风味：花香、橘子硬糖、蜂蜜\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          Floral, Orange drops, Honeyed\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          很特别的一个日晒批次，它的香气和酸甜整体的感受是我从来没有的风味经历，入口的酸甜酸感没有上面那一只那么的上扬和扎实，但是它的很轻盈的花香柑橘和硬糖蜂蜜甜让你会大口大口的还在自习品味琢磨它的风味的过程中就喝完了一杯～中温开始的酸甜还有一些像那种溜溜梅的酸甜，超级喜欢！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n           处理过程\n          </span>\n          ：鲜果采收后，运送到Alto Lino处理厂，进行浮选后装入袋中放在小溪里静置发酵（目前还在确认发酵的时长信息）；然后取出咖啡果放置在干燥室的晒床上进行4天的初始干燥，含水率大概下降到45%左右，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          再将咖啡果放入塑料袋中发酵3天，发酵结束后\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          再将咖啡果放置于18摄氏度恒温，湿度50%的干燥室中干燥35天；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmecoa_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7SLofqLUD3YoN4W9O154rkDV2wTLwakCWF5FVm0GMnNcj3x6htm2YKa2hbGpbwYU3OficeGsrYF98A%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4060548511664963589\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4060548511664963589\" data-vidtype=\"2\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          // 这两只日晒发酵的批次刚好可以做个对比，对比看看不同的发酵温度条件和次数对于风味的差异影响；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n            地块：Dilgo\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n            处理方式：水洗 Washed\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n            采收日期：2025.1.26 &amp; 2025.2.25(两个水洗批次合并）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n           烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n           风\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n           味：洋甘菊、葡萄柚、红茶和红糖甜\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n           Chamomile, Grapefruit, Black tea and Brow sugar-like sweetness\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n           水洗是两个批次合并的，他们的处理方式是一样的，只是鲜果批次不同，喝起来一个入口会酸感强一些，会像柚子和葡萄的调性，一个会更甜有类似去年的Alessa水洗批次的那种红糖和烤红薯甜，所以我就把它们合并在一起了，他们相比这回选到的翡翠面纱的水洗批次风味强度稍显弱一些，但也能喝到相似的风味方向，可以比较看看哈～\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n           处理过程：鲜果采收后，送到Alto Lino处理厂，进行浮选，然后第二天脱皮后将咖啡豆（带着果胶）放置在开放式的发酵罐中静置发酵16小时，然后加压水冲洗后，放置在干燥室内的晒床上晾晒干燥8天；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3ykia8xvZEZJz5dqCuu72l7aG2PQnrjtGQiciawIVv4G1Bv47P4uiaOtExQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           图片来源：CAFE IMPORTS\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于养豆、储存和冲煮\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QLIPGSSQh4nI0FCAicmOMOsk7LzC6x6rJHIwib3X2vm9TynezYliaYorfbicaias0OvbC10xEQXicU3Zyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px;height: 940px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QLIPGSSQh4nI0FCAicmOMOsqibSn6gSselHSs3cl8ibHHsQJ88Kxyk0ziaYdKTMxq0bNyVc9Jc3dw2ow/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px;height: 730px;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于Altieri庄园\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           阿尔铁里庄园是由意大利裔美国商人\n          </span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span>\n            Eugene Altieri于2000年创立的，目前家族第二代也参与到管理事务中；阿尔铁里在\n           </span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span>\n             博奎特\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n            有2个农场，分别是位于Palo Alto河的\n           </span>\n<span style='letter-spacing: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n             Finca La Asunción（\n            </span>\n<span style='font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);float: none;display: inline !important;'>\n<span>\n              Pipim Estate ）\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n            与位于\n           </span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span>\n             Callejón Seco的Mima‘s Estate\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n            ；\n           </span>\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n             Finca La Asunción\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n            有12公顷，种植海拔低一些，在1250-1375米，主要种植卡杜拉和卡杜艾；\n           </span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span>\n             Mima‘s Estate\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span>\n             农场种植面积45公顷，海拔1700-2200米之间，种植品种有铁皮卡、卡杜艾和瑰夏；\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TBfL1MFURbyOfmm0j3m8hSIADzEU2m9UWwBSJWJOkLKkz0ojAbDMYUABkNjNN0BAHibaerqxiayF2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TBfL1MFURbyOfmm0j3m8hSamyBFp7DL4cMyEkp07Z03lkDaT4pPtA3nabhHAJI4uocWjNORnSoQg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;'>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span>\n           瑰夏是庄园主Eugene Altieri于2011年从翡翠庄园购得的种子开始尝试种植在\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span>\n           Callejón Seco农场1800米海拔，由于其风味和经济价值特殊性，它也发展成庄园目前种植面积最多的品种；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SwohlcAHRJiaOV3WnzWmTcad2uNpc9cibicNmfxibFkkHAvf2TQvZ9N52zDBiaIrQ5jp9OndMgWIjWqWg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;'>\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TBfL1MFURbyOfmm0j3m8hShZREBDHClyQtiaKt4ms51GpkTeOUhHliamz5zjHnCu5L2hozrcpeRrcQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
